OL,3,CBowls and boxing medals for NI at
OL,4,CCommonwealth Games
OL,6,FIt has been another exciting day at
OL,7,Fthe Commonwealth Games for Northern
OL,8,FIreland, with medal success in bowls
OL,9,Fand boxing.
OL,11,FChloe Wilson and Shauna O'Neill came
OL,12,Ffrom behind to win 2-0 over Wales and
OL,13,Fclaim third place in the women's pairs
OL,14,Fin bowling.
OL,16,F"We've been through so much together
OL,17,Ffrom junior level right up to senior
OL,18,Fso it's just a really special moment
OL,19,Fto be doing it together," Chloe said.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/3
