OL,3,CBowls and boxing medals for NI at
OL,4,CCommonwealth Games
OL,6,FThen in the men's singles bronze
OL,7,Fdecider, Ballymoney's Gary Kelly added
OL,8,Fanother medal to the collection.
OL,10,FThe 36-year-old competes at the
OL,11,Fhighest level in Australia, but said:
OL,12,F"I never forget my roots, I'm a proud
OL,13,FNorthern Ireland man and I'm so glad
OL,14,Fthey showcase that trust and belief in
OL,15,Fme."
OL,17,FMeanwhile in boxing, Kaci Rock has
OL,18,Fsecured at least a bronze medal after
OL,19,Fa unanimous points win in the 64kg
OL,20,Fquarter finals.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/3
